Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_32=§7If §e§oGood (6~15)§7 it will produce less power and heal the player by §a5 HP§7, with a §a50%§7 chance to increase the Qliphoth Counter by 1
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_33=§7If §c§oPoor (0~15)§7 it will apply debuffs to the player, spawn several monsters, and shut down
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_34=§cEvery 10 maintenance will increase the Qliphoth Meltdown Level by 1§7, maximum level is §a10§7, each level reduces the success rate of probability checks by §c1%
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_35=§7Whenever the Qliphoth Meltdown Level increases, the machine will enter §cQliphoth Energy Meltdown State§7, requiring immediate maintenance, time limit §a1 minute
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_36=§7If no maintenance is performed during the §cQliphoth Energy Meltdown State§7, the Qliphoth Counter will immediately drop to §c0§7 after the countdown ends
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_37=§7As the Qliphoth Meltdown Level increases, it will generate §oDawn, Noon, Dusk, Midnight§7 trials
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_38=§7The types of trials include §aGreen§7, §6Amber§7, §dViolet§7, §cBlood§7, §9Indigo
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_39=§7If §cQliphoth Meltdown Level reaches 10§7, all trial types will become §oPale§7, difficulty and rewards will significantly increase
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_40=§7Completing trials will generate a portion of the machine's EU per second multiplied by the total time spent:
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_41=§eDawn: 10%
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_42=§eNoon: 15%
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_43=§eDusk: 20%
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_44=§eMidnight: 25%
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_45=§cWhen the Qliphoth Counter is 0, it will trigger a massive explosion causing 500 billion pollution
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_46=§cGenerates a large number of monsters, 11 Ender Dragons, and 1 Wither. Cannot be restarted until no Wither or Ender Dragons are detected within the range.
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_47=§cPlayers within the range will receive 500 magic damage + 5000 physical damage.
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_48=§7Generates §a2147483647 * Total damage dealt to all entities * Entity type * 500§7 EU per second during operation. Requires a Force Field Generator in the host to complete structure check.
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_49=§7Fixed operation time of §a500 seconds§7.
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_50=§0§o§mInstall the Final Spiral to ignore the above mechanisms.
Tooltip_WhiteNightGenerator_51=§c§oNote: EU cache will be generated inside the machine during operation. Destruction will immediately cause an explosion!
